+"""Exp 5015 genuine self-consistency baseline fix.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-KONA-5015, SCENARIO-KONA-5015-GENUINE-SC,
+SCENARIO-KONA-5015-DEGENERACY-GUARD, SCENARIO-KONA-5015-SMOKE.
+"""
